    "name": "Mination",
    "steam_appid": 3534170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/b5538ca07d78adfd024a493c8c48860b.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/b5538ca07d78adfd024a493c8c48860b.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/b5538ca07d78adfd024a493c8c48860b.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mination is an arcade twin-stick shooter/survivor with roguelite and story elements. Go ahead and aim for that highscore on the leaderboard! Take control of Minerva as she mines ores for space-pennies in the vastness of space while dealing with enemies that just want to be a menace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine Ores and Prepare Your Defenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/2e8e037e01e8321bfae3e434ae09f420.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/2e8e037e01e8321bfae3e434ae09f420.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/2e8e037e01e8321bfae3e434ae09f420.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send those ores to Chief and he'll (begrudgingly) give you an upgrade for your defenses. Add and level up weapons by collecting more ores and defend yourself from enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/e56ee2e3aafea6b7abd44b8ee2000949.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/e56ee2e3aafea6b7abd44b8ee2000949.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/e56ee2e3aafea6b7abd44b8ee2000949.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/01769a480e8790f0ec60ee426665d29a.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/01769a480e8790f0ec60ee426665d29a.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/01769a480e8790f0ec60ee426665d29a.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the space-dollars to upgrade your ship and get right back into mining. (That's right, Chief doesn't pay for it. Should've looked at that contract before signing.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Interesting Characters and Progress the Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/4ae16776fa7806b17e59c977b989ee94.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/4ae16776fa7806b17e59c977b989ee94.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/4ae16776fa7806b17e59c977b989ee94.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and interact with interesting characters and learn more about them and the world as you play. They might even give you some small gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/b5538ca07d78adfd024a493c8c48860b.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/b5538ca07d78adfd024a493c8c48860b.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/b5538ca07d78adfd024a493c8c48860b.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mination is an arcade twin-stick shooter/survivor with roguelite and story elements. Go ahead and aim for that highscore on the leaderboard! Take control of Minerva as she mines ores for space-pennies in the vastness of space while dealing with enemies that just want to be a menace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine Ores and Prepare Your Defenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/2e8e037e01e8321bfae3e434ae09f420.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/2e8e037e01e8321bfae3e434ae09f420.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/2e8e037e01e8321bfae3e434ae09f420.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send those ores to Chief and he'll (begrudgingly) give you an upgrade for your defenses. Add and level up weapons by collecting more ores and defend yourself from enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/e56ee2e3aafea6b7abd44b8ee2000949.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/e56ee2e3aafea6b7abd44b8ee2000949.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/e56ee2e3aafea6b7abd44b8ee2000949.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/01769a480e8790f0ec60ee426665d29a.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/01769a480e8790f0ec60ee426665d29a.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/01769a480e8790f0ec60ee426665d29a.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the space-dollars to upgrade your ship and get right back into mining. (That's right, Chief doesn't pay for it. Should've looked at that contract before signing.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Interesting Characters and Progress the Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/4ae16776fa7806b17e59c977b989ee94.poster.avif?t=1739918273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/4ae16776fa7806b17e59c977b989ee94.webm?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534170/extras/4ae16776fa7806b17e59c977b989ee94.mp4?t=1739918273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and interact with interesting characters and learn more about them and the world as you play. They might even give you some small gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Mination is an arcade twin-stick shooter/survivor with roguelite and story elements. Take control of Minerva as she mines ores, avoids or fight pirates and aims for a high score! Earn space-dollars to upgrade your ship, progress the story to unlock rewards and head back to get on that leaderboard!",
